    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d582">

                <pb facs="0885" n="875" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg875"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commander of the Seventh Fleet</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cooke</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to General Marshall
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-09-19">19 September 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>180830Z. Withdrawal of Marines from coal mines and railroad bridges began on 15
                    September. Marine[s] withdrawn from Sinshi Mines on 17 September. My
                        040538Z<anchor n="62" xml:id="d582-f1"/> refers.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
